flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Read OLED switch state and receiver OLED flag]

    B --> C[Set switchState value]

    C --> D[Print OLED switch state information]

    D --> E{Switch OFF and OLED active and not sleeping}

    E -- Yes --> F[Print OLED turning OFF message]
    F --> G[Enable OLED power save]
    G --> H[Set OLED active flag false]
    H --> I([End])

    E -- No --> J{Switch ON and not sleeping}

    J -- Yes --> K[Print OLED turning ON message]
    K --> L[Disable OLED power save]
    L --> M[Set OLED active flag true]
    M --> I

    J -- No --> I
